[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん！\u3000水着の出来はどう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! How did the swimsuits turn out?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人ともかわいくできた……かな？\n機能はバッチリだと思うよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think they both came out cute! And they should work perfectly for swimming!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、登場を待ちますかー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let's wait for their grand entrance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "と、話をすれば早速！\nアンチュ！\u3000こっちこっち！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, speak of the devil! Antje! Over here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、待たせたわ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-sorry I kept you waiting..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあああ！\u3000かわいい！\u3000アンチュによく似合ってる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wooow! So cute! It looks amazing on you, Antje!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……恥ずかしい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... This is embarrassing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "恥ずかしがることないよ！\nこんなに素敵なんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's nothing to be embarrassed about! You look absolutely wonderful!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう？\u3000ありがと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so? Thanks..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしてもヨハナは遅いなあ。\nなにしてるんだろ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna sure is taking her time though. I wonder what she's doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ちょっと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Just a minute."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ヨハナちゃん！\u3000水着どうだった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Johanna! How's your swimsuit?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおおーーー！！！\u3000ヨハナもかわいい！\nやっぱりヨハナはこういうのが似合うよね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooooh! Johanna looks so cute too! This style really suits you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "似合うよね……じゃないわよ！\nどうしてこんなに子どもっぽいの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't just say 'it suits me'! Why is this so childish?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "子どもっぽいかな？\nかわいくなるように作ってみたんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it childish? I tried to make it as cute as possible..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はもっとかっこいいのが良かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted something cooler!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ご、ごめん……次はもっと頑張ってみるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-sorry... I'll try harder next time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う……別にレスナのせいってわけじゃ……。\n私もちゃんと見てなかったのが悪いし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... It's not really your fault... I should have paid more attention too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあまあ。とにかくこれで水着は揃ったね！\nそしたら、次はどうする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, now. At least we've got all our swimsuits sorted! So what's next?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特に制限とかはないという話だったから、\n船とか水中を進む道具を用意しようかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They said there weren't any particular restrictions, so I thought I'd prepare some boats or underwater gear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え。じゃあなんでわざわざ海辺まで来たのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Then why did we bother coming all the way to the beach?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、水着を着るならここでしょ？\nせっかくなんだから少し泳いで遊ぼうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, if we're wearing swimsuits, this is the place to be! Since we're here, let's swim and have some fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ。ま、それも面白そうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. Well, that does sound interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あの……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの、アンチュちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong, Antje?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、あまり泳いだことなくて……\n泳ぎ方、教えてもらえるかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I haven't really swum much before... Could you teach me how?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたそんなんで大会に出るつもりだったの？\nま、私に任せなさい！\u3000天才が一から教えてあげるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were planning to enter the tournament like that? Well, leave it to me! This genius will teach you from the ground up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……敵に塩を送るつもり？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Isn't that helping the enemy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん。張り合いがないとつまらないからよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. It's no fun if there's no competition!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。仲良しさんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. You two are such good friends."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「違うわ」「違うわよ！」",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"We're not!\" \"We are not!\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ/ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje/Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]